Z||000000||kornholio||04-09-2000||02:55 PM||||What's involved in replacing a positive battery cable on a V6?  Thanks.||||reg||5
Z||000002||Oreif||04-09-2000||07:11 PM||||A couple of wrenches, jack stands, and a new battery cable. Sometimes you may need to get a new terminal connector for the battery side of the cable depending on the brand, to hook up the secondary wire.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Patrick||04-10-2000||12:07 AM||||<BR>Just make sure the <I>negative</I> terminal is disconnected the whole time!||||reg||1
